loose subsystem, housing, and lever with my hand and a wrench, alternating between the machine spinning, the lever falling, and the machine catching. I break the housing, the machine breaks again, and both the subsystem and machine remain."}, {"id": "R035", "text": "I leave the machine under the bench, place the subsystem under a loose leaf, and put the broken part beside it. I leave the machine open and prioritize reliability over recovering the subsystem."}, {"id": "R036", "text": "I place the subsystem, machine, and rust in a step, moving the subsystem once and repeatedly putting the wrong item or tool in place. I ultimately leave the subsystem there."}]
